# Payments back from payers, one claim per row, flattened from 835 remittance files.
# name          type      required?  pattern, or allowed values separated by |
claim_id        int       required
payer           enum      required   Medicare|Medicaid|Anthem BCBS|Healthfirst|NYCE PPO
paid            decimal   required
adjustment      decimal   optional
carc            code      optional   ^(CO|PR|OA|PI)-[0-9]+$
service_date    date      required
paid_date       date      required
